        "text": "Enforcement through border control is feasible and effective.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Immigration policy must be guided primarily by national interest rather than purely humanitarian concerns.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "A functioning democracy requires clear, enforceable rules on entry to maintain order and legitimacy.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "People entering the U.S. should be evaluated based on their potential contribution to the economy and society.",
