    "turn_text": "Let's check out inflation. The question is, what are you going to do there? I just checked this morning. I think the U.S. inflation rate is around 2.7 percent. Well, thereabouts, which is levels of around 2020-2021. If it's going to be that low, maybe you should just go to Congress and just continue to ride the lightning of Biden-flation.",
