    "turn_text": "Well, a couple of points on that. I mean, one, it's like a ratchet, right? It ratcheted up heavily and now that the ratchet has slowed down its rate, you know, folks on one side of the debate like to say, look how low inflation is. We have the ratchet still way up. And so",
