      },
      {
        "text": "Federal spending has increased significantly over the past three and a half years.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Deficit-financed spending contributes to inflation.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Passing a law to simply make inflation disappear is not feasible.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Much of recent federal spending is financed through deficits.",
