      },
      {
        "text": "Reducing government spending and deficits will lead to lower inflation in the long run.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Mentioning Elon Musk and Vivek Ramaswami lends credibility to the argument about fiscal discipline.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a consensus among influential figures on the importance of fiscal restraint.",
        "confidence": 0.85
