    "turn_text": "So you supported the election of Mr. Trump, and I was wondering of what you think about the President-elect's repeated statements about throwing his adversaries in prison night. As you said, you're a fan of the rule of law. Do you think the threat is real? And if so, what damage would it cause? If not, why undermine important institutions by talking like this?",
